(Data Retention and Access Policy \(Version 2.0\)) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(1. Purpose: this policy defines how long lakehouse data is kept and who may access it.) Tj T*
(2. Bronze data is retained for 90 days, then deleted by the scheduled VACUUM job.) Tj T*
(3. Silver data is retained for 3 years. Gold data products are retained for 7 years.) Tj T*
(4. Personal data \(names, e-mail addresses, phone numbers\) must be masked in Gold tables.) Tj T*
(5. Access to Silver and Gold tables is granted through Unity Catalog groups only.) Tj T*
(6. Service principals used by pipelines receive the minimum privileges they need.) Tj T*
(7. Pipeline logs must not contain credentials, tokens or personal data.) Tj T*
(8. Exceptions require written approval from the Data Governance Board.) Tj T*
ET
